 "remarks": "Recently updated first-floor apartment. Located in an excellent, private location close to downtown and its amenities. Victorian style with lots of character and charm and 10-foot ceilings. This unit offers 900 square feet of open concept and very functional living space. Key features include: - Private entrance (no elevators required) - Floor-to-ceiling flagstone fireplace and built-in bookcase - Oversized kitchen with a built-in bar, granite countertops, and stainless steel appliances - Assigned parking space, plus additional visitor parking - Laundry inside unit. 3 min from down town, close to the highways, restaurants and shopping centers. Book your showing appointment today..!",
